      "statement": "`./install.sh` builds `bin/agent-harness` from `./cmd/harness` (skippable with `--skip-build`), adds `--interactive` when run with no arguments in a TTY, and execs `agent-harness install`; `--dry-run --json` prints the complete change plan before anything is modified.",
