      "id": "claim_bee330fe8de84e5ca8e98acb99ae3848",
      "statement": "A default install touches only user-level host configuration (command shims under `~/.local/bin`, per-host skill links, MCP registration, SessionStart hook); target repositories get files only through explicit `project bootstrap` or `--project-local` opt-in, which creates `.claude/skills/*`, `.mcp.json`, `.omo/skills/*`, and `.omo/mcp.json` but never repo-local hook registration.",
