    {
      "id": "claim_4615672f7b6b45929a32d15bdd6bc12a",
      "statement": "`agent-harness` is the canonical command and `ah` is the installer-managed short symlink at `~/.local/bin/ah` pointing at the same command path; the installer refuses to replace an existing regular file at that path or a symlink pointing anywhere other than the managed command, so `ah update` always runs the checkout's built binary without needing `git pull`.",
