    {
      "id": "claim_63151be232ef4026acb5c1617a4739f8",
      "statement": "The docs index is a contract-pinned surface: the docs-index golden validates only the required-doc projection and count/schema (deliberately insensitive to document body/list churn), and `agent-harness docs --json` is part of the minimum completion gate.",
