    {
      "id": "claim_2097e7b1b3bf453d974bd50765c1ad2c",
      "statement": "Verification is single-run: when any step of a multi-stage verification fails, earlier passes are not reused and the entire battery must be rerun from the first gate; completion evidence must come from one full passing run, never a combination of partial passes from different runs.",
