    {
      "id": "claim_af2cb79ecca547be89ce877329bc4caa",
      "statement": "The self-verify gate is deterministic and model-free by default — pinned seed, LLM eval off — and CI is pure wiring of the same local gates (gofmt, vet, golangci-lint, skill frontmatter validation, Python validator unit tests, build, full and race test suites, then the seed-pinned self-verify gate after a native install into a temporary HOME) with no live-skill invocation or model required.",
